    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To explore the celestial island where our protagonists awaken, sprint and jump with Fox, even on walls, and hop or fly above the ground with Finch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to solve puzzles made up of strange, numbered, colored jelly cubes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fox &amp; Finch can push them their own way to match numbered tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- When pressed against obstacles jellies merge if their sum don\u2019t top 10.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn their specificities, linked to their colors that mix, such as sliding, trampoline, or adhesion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also discover other mechanisms that appear along the journey, adding features as subtraction or water control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region has its own puzzle mechanics and biome variation paired with a seemingly fossilized animal titan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 7th area concludes the journey by combining the discovered mechanics, and revealing the celestial island purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lore is told through environment with occasional expressive close-ups on Fox &amp; finch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From 6  to 99 years old, play with logic and 3D navigation in solo or coop (with 1 screen or split screen or online) in this 4 hours adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To explore the celestial island where our protagonists awaken, sprint and jump with Fox, even on walls, and hop or fly above the ground with Finch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will need to solve puzzles made up of strange, numbered, colored jelly cubes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fox &amp; Finch can push them their own way to match numbered tiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- When pressed against obstacles jellies merge if their sum don\u2019t top 10.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn their specificities, linked to their colors that mix, such as sliding, trampoline, or adhesion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also discover other mechanisms that appear along the journey, adding features as subtraction or water control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each region has its own puzzle mechanics and biome variation paired with a seemingly fossilized animal titan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 7th area concludes the journey by combining the discovered mechanics, and revealing the celestial island purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lore is told through environment with occasional expressive close-ups on Fox &amp; finch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From 6  to 99 years old, play with logic and 3D navigation in solo or coop (with 1 screen or split screen or online) in this 4 hours adventure.</p>",
